/** The Stellar network is the deployment's (`SCF_STELLAR_NETWORK`), never the client's choice (C-114). `sep10` needs the deployment's SEP-10 signing key (`SCF_SEP10_SIGNING_SEED`, C-15); without it the challenge answers `503`. SEP-10 signatures must reach the account's medium threshold (multisig, C-19). */
